<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">pyretic-surge</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Pyretic Surge</ansi> spell superheats the target's blood to the point of
violent combustion, dealing severe damage in a single concentrated
burst. The internal heat overwhelms the body's defenses, making it
particularly potent against robust physical opponents.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast pyretic-surge [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Elemental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 8
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 40
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — quick reflexes can dodge it; armor only
                 softens what lands
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Heavy direct damage to a single target

